====== Inteno DG301B ======

Inteno DG301B(R0) comes with OpenWrt (Inteno Iopsys) from vendor, although their own build of it.

===== Hardware Highlights =====

^ Ver ^ CPU ^ Ram ^ Flash ^ Network ^ Wireless ^ USB ^ Serial ^ JTag ^
| v1 | Broadcom 63268 | 256MiB | 128MiB | 1 WAN + 4x LAN (GBit) | Broadcom BCM435f 802.11bgn 2x2 | Yes 2x 2.0 | Yes | No | 

Manufacturer's site: [[https://www.intenogroup.com/products/legacy/dg301/]]

Forum: [[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=57812]]



